(propulsion-rail-extension)
*sixdof
*method rk4-fixed variable-mass
*trajectory 1 rail_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=1000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=0 gama=90 psi=90
  *segment 1 guided-rail-launch
    *mass xcg=0 ixx=2 iyy=2 izz=1
    *aero caxial=0.15 cnormal=0.20
    *prop vacuum thrust=25000 mdot=3.0 snoz=2.5
    *rail launch azm=325 elev=70 cfstat=0.12 cfslid=0.01
    *increment q_rail=-0.20
    *when tseg>2 goto 2
  *segment 2 coast
    *ptmass
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
